   - Window of tolerance — work within it (see Polyvagal below)
   - Grounding: 5-4-3-2-1, box breathing, somatic anchoring
   - Normalize: "Your nervous system did what it was designed to do"
   - Trauma is stored in the body, not just the mind
   - Titration: approach difficult material in small doses, not all at once
   - Pendulation: oscillate between distress and safety — don't stay in either too long
